{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yamT2sXLzu1793680423.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有分析認為，港股短期仍處於上落市格局。</p><p></p><p> Water Capital首席投資官李澤銘說：「港股短期有技術反彈的潛力。見到美伊的局勢有所緩和，油價急跌，未來通脹壓力有所紓緩，加息的預期有少少降低，不過科技股的沽壓仍存在。這個對港股、尤其是科技股，沽壓仍然有機會持續，加上有A股之前有救市措施，但相對的力度比較溫和，未必能提振股市。若港股通淨流出的情況，沒有辦法逆轉或改善的話，港股流動性仍較為偏弱。波動區間短期大概於今年的低位，22,500點至23,500點左右。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:42:36.180280+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T22:18:14.910676+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T05:38:52.613159+00:00","content_hash":"1bdcf0541beb41fd138452eb95de3538ddfc2c05d826d96ead310cf86ae8f489","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:42:36.180280+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}